\title{The metric and the heat trace}
\date{2026-11-07}

\p{The Hausdorff dimension in \ref{fdip-00E9} is a property of
the [dyadic increment](fdip-00E5) and of the shorter-arc
metric. \ref{fdip-00CT} is a statement about windows of the
heat trace of the cycle. The dimension leaves that
heat-trace statement unchanged.}
